<title>UK: Reuters 59th ex-UK air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 59th ex-UK air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK GBP air cargo market rates per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one. Rates are inclusive of cargo fuel surcharges being applied to airlines.</p>
<p>			 Jan 24	    Jan 10</p>
<p>		  UNITED STATES</p>
<p>  LON-JFK	    0.64		0.62</p>
<p>  LON-LAX	    0.75		0.73</p>
<p>  LON-CHI	    0.76		0.73</p>
<p>		  ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p>  LON-HKG	    1.23		1.23</p>
<p>  LON-SIN	    1.29		1.29</p>
<p>  LON-NRT	    2.04		2.04</p>
<p>  LON-SEL	    2.02		2.02</p>
<p>  LON-SYD	    2.15		2.15</p>
<p>		  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>  LON-DXB	    0.81		0.81</p>
<p>  LON-BAH	    0.93		0.93</p>
<p>		  AFRICA</p>
<p>  LON-JNB	    1.72		1.73</p>
<p>		  SCANDINAVIA</p>
<p>  LON-STO	    0.75		0.75</p>
<p>  LON-CPH	    0.70		0.70</p>
<p>		  LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>  LON-SAO	    2.06		2.04</p>
<p>  LON-BUE	    2.19		2.19</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in sterling.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity.</p>
<p>-- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
